The milestone tree from the plugin's config names its directory and file after the same
id/slug pair, and puts every --set value through tojson — a title carrying a colon, an
apostrophe and quotes stays one readable YAML scalar, and a zero-padded id stays a string.

-- cmd --
booping scaffold core.groom_playbook.milestone_scaffold plans/demo/milestones --set id=01 --set slug=cli-surface --set "title=Demo: it's \"fine\"" --set sp=3 --set plan=plans/demo/index.md
